{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-message-minimap#card-zh","repo":"AFAP/dsh-message-minimap","commit":"31de99238635679d2a78d5113e0d58155366f4b9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-minimap 是一个面向 DSH Web 会话的用户消息导航条，在聊天窗左侧按轮次显示刻度，并通过 conversation.session.header.utilities 槽位挂载。它从 turnOutline 投影生成全会话刻度，标亮视口内轮次；悬停可预览提示词和时间，点击刻度可跳转并按需加载旧历史，拖动轨道可按比例浏览长会话。还会在投影不可用时退回已渲染轮次，并随滚动、流式内容和窗口变化更新。适合需要快速回看长对话中自己发言的 DSH Web 用户；需要支持对应客户端槽位和会话接口的 DSH Web 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:337-363","lib/client.js:466-498","lib/client.js:820-845"]}
{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-message-minimap#card-en","repo":"AFAP/dsh-message-minimap","commit":"31de99238635679d2a78d5113e0d58155366f4b9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-message-minimap adds a tick rail beside DSH Web chats. It uses turnOutline to show turns, highlights visible messages, previews prompts, and jumps to selected turns, loading older history when needed. Without the projection, it shows rendered turns. For revisiting long conversations.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:337-363","lib/client.js:466-498","lib/client.js:820-845"]}
