{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-message-minimap#feature-1","repo":"AFAP/dsh-message-minimap","commit":"31de99238635679d2a78d5113e0d58155366f4b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-minimap 的功能「按会话轮次显示导航刻度」：导航条从 turnOutline 投影读取整段会话的轮次，并为每轮绘制一个均匀分布的刻度；投影不可用时改用当前已渲染的用户消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:301-317","lib/client.js:466-498"]}
{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-message-minimap#feature-2","repo":"AFAP/dsh-message-minimap","commit":"31de99238635679d2a78d5113e0d58155366f4b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-minimap 的功能「预览提示词与时间」：悬停或键盘聚焦刻度时显示轮次序号、提示词摘要和已渲染消息的时间；时间仅在对应轮次已加载时提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:167-187","lib/client.js:736-767","lib/client.js:798-813"]}
{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-message-minimap#feature-3","repo":"AFAP/dsh-message-minimap","commit":"31de99238635679d2a78d5113e0d58155366f4b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-minimap 的功能「点击刻度跳转到发言」：点击刻度后平滑滚动到对应用户消息；若目标尚未加载，则调用会话 loadThrough，或逐页加载旧历史并等待目标出现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:605-689"]}
{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-message-minimap#feature-4","repo":"AFAP/dsh-message-minimap","commit":"31de99238635679d2a78d5113e0d58155366f4b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-minimap 的功能「拖动轨道按比例浏览」：点击或拖动导航轨道背景，按轨道位置换算聊天滚动偏移；拖动时使用指针捕获并持续更新位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:691-710"]}
